  "content": "\n\n<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CIPYHp0.png\" alt=\"標題\" /></h1>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-enchanted-books-hotfix\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1086209?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-enchanted-books-hotfix\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/cit-enchanted-books-hotfix?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a> </strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">此模組修復了 1.20.5 至 1.21.3 版本中針對附魔書的 CIT 材質包問題。此為過渡性修正，直到 CIT Resewn 或 OptiFine 等模組恢復此功能為止。下方展示使用的是我的材質包 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/different-textures-for-enchanted-books\">火星附魔書</a>。不過此模組與幾乎所有新增附魔書圖紋的材質包皆相容。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Muod80.png\" width=\"484\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p></center>\n<details>\n<summary><strong>設定</strong></summary>\n<p>您可以在遊戲內直接設定此模組，或是編輯您資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/cithotfix.json</code>。若您使用 Fabric 並希望在遊戲內調整設定值，則需要安裝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\">Mod Menu</a>。</p>\n<center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>possible_roots</b> - 設定此模組應檢查哪些資源包路徑以套用附魔書的 CIT</p>\n</center>\n</details>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"/>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"/></a>\n</p></center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
